	<section_number>37.2-612</section_number>
	<catch_line>Liability for expenses of services</catch_line>
	<text>
		Individuals receiving services shall be liable for the expenses of services provided by a behavioral health authority in the same manner that they are liable to community services boards, as set forth in § 37.2-511.
	</text>
	<history>1995, c. 693, § 15.1-1682; 1996, c. 861; 1997, cc. 587, 743, § 37.1-248; 1998, c. 680; 2005, c. 716; 2012, cc. 476, 507.</history>
